{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>On the twenty-seventh day of the month.</b> This is the month of Marcheshvan. Above it said that they were released on the seventeenth day, and here, if it had said 'on the seventeenth day of the month the earth dried,' it would have been understood that the Flood lasted a full year day for day, which is 354 days, that being the lunar year. Therefore it added eleven and said 'on the twenty-seventh day of the month the earth dried,' to indicate that it was a solar year of 365 days, for thus a solar year exceeds a lunar year by eleven days. On this the Sages, blessed be their memory, said: the judgment of the generation of the Flood was twelve months; the judgment of Egypt in Egypt, twelve months; the judgment of Job, twelve months; the judgment of the wicked in Gehenna, twelve months; the judgment of Gog and Magog, twelve months." "<b>The earth dried.</b> Nevertheless, he did not go out until he was given permission to go out, and the Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: 'Go forth from the ark.' For since he entered it by reason of the commandment of HaShem, may He be exalted, he did not wish to leave there except by His command." "<b>And they said</b> in the Midrash: from here Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah learned not to go out from inside the fiery furnace until the king commanded them — as it is written (Daniel 3:13): 'Then Nebuchadnezzar… go forth and come' (פוקו ואתו), whereas above it said 'ascend' (סקו). For at first the furnace was deep and it was necessary to say 'ascend'; but now the furnace was raised by way of a miracle and levelled to the ground, and it was necessary to say 'go forth' (פוקו). And they did not wish to go out until the king commanded them."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Resolves רז\"ל as 'the Sages, blessed be their memory' (חכמים זכרונם לברכה); the abbreviation could also read 'Rabbanan zikhronam livrakha' but context favors the standard rendering."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:11:18.844041451Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}